sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Ingress as Platform Ingress<br/>(Gateway API HTTPRoute<br/>/ OpenShift Route)
    participant Router as InferenceGraph Router<br/>(cmd/router)
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP TLS 1.2+
    participant Predictor as Predictor Pod<br/>(Model Server)
    participant Storage as Object Storage<br/>(S3 / Azure / GCS)
    participant Prometheus as Prometheus<br/>(Monitoring)
    participant KRBACProxy as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>8443/TCP TLS
    participant Manager as KServe Manager<br/>8080/TCP

    Note over Client,Storage: Model Serving Request Path (Direct InferenceService)

    Client->>Ingress: POST /v2/models/{model}/infer<br/>HTTPS/443 TLS 1.2+
    Ingress->>Predictor: Forward Request<br/>(V2 Inference Protocol)
    Predictor->>Storage: Load Model Artifacts<br/>HTTPS/443 (IAM/AccessKey)
    Storage-->>Predictor: Model Weights
    Predictor-->>Ingress: Prediction Response (JSON/gRPC)
    Ingress-->>Client: Response

    Note over Client,Storage: InferenceGraph Request Path (with Auth)

    Client->>Ingress: POST /v2/models/{graph}/infer<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    Ingress->>Router: Forward to Router
    Router->>K8sAPI: TokenReview<br/>(validate bearer token)
    K8sAPI-->>Router: Token Valid
    Router->>K8sAPI: SubjectAccessReview<br/>(authorize InferenceGraph access)
    K8sAPI-->>Router: Authorized
    Router->>Predictor: Fan-out to model nodes<br/>(splitter/ensemble/switch/sequence)
    Predictor-->>Router: Prediction Results
    Router-->>Ingress: Aggregated Response
    Ingress-->>Client: JSON Response

    Note over K8sAPI,Manager: Control Plane Reconciliation

    K8sAPI->>Manager: InferenceService CR event<br/>(watch notification)
    Manager->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Deployment<br/>ServiceAccount token auth
    Manager->>K8sAPI: Create HPA / KEDA ScaledObject
    Manager->>K8sAPI: Create HTTPRoute / Route / VirtualService
    Manager->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Service

    Note over Prometheus,Manager: Metrics Collection

    Prometheus->>KRBACProxy: GET /metrics<br/>HTTPS/8443 TLS
    KRBACProxy->>KRBACProxy: TLS termination +<br/>Kubernetes AuthN/AuthZ
    KRBACProxy->>Manager: Proxy to :8080<br/>HTTP (localhost)
    Manager-->>KRBACProxy: Prometheus metrics
    KRBACProxy-->>Prometheus: Metrics response

    Note over K8sAPI,Storage: Local Model Caching Flow

    K8sAPI->>Manager: LocalModelCache CR event
    Manager->>K8sAPI: Create PersistentVolume
    Manager->>K8sAPI: Create PersistentVolumeClaim
    Manager->>K8sAPI: Create download Job
    Manager->>Storage: Job downloads model<br/>to local PV
    Storage-->>Manager: Model artifacts cached
    Manager->>K8sAPI: Update InferenceService<br/>reference to local PV
